# 🐍 Installing Python - Your First Step!
#
# Python is one of the most beginner-friendly and powerful programming languages.
# Let’s learn how to install it on your system.

# ------------------------------------------------
# 🔹 Why Python?
# ------------------------------------------------
# - Beginner-friendly language
# - Powerful for data science, AI, and web development
# - Large community support

# ------------------------------------------------
# 💻 Installation Steps
# ------------------------------------------------

# 🪟 Windows:
# 1. Visit: https://www.python.org/downloads/
# 2. Download Python 3.11+ (latest stable version)
# 3. Check the box: "Add Python to PATH"
# 4. Click "Install Now" and finish setup

# 🍏 Mac:
# Using Homebrew (recommended):
#   brew install python
#
# Or download directly from: https://www.python.org/downloads/

# ------------------------------------------------
# ✅ Verify Installation
# ------------------------------------------------
# Open terminal/command prompt and type:
#   python --version
#   # or
#   python3 --version
#
# You should see something like:
#   Python 3.11.4

# 🎉 Congratulations! Python is installed and ready to use!
